**Status:** TODO.

The pipeline is: search (recorded here) -> screen -> extract -> aggregate -> synthesize. "Reproduce" means
regenerating the aggregates and checking each source still resolves from `evidence/manifest.yaml` and the
committed extraction records. It does not mean re-running the search or any paid AI step.

