## Fetching data

When one fetch command covers several sources, try them all; report each failure with the next step and
exit non-zero if any failed. A missing account must not stop public downloads. Never silently overwrite a
raw file; say it exists and how to refresh it. Document a manual download for each account-required source.

## Decision log

Record each substantive decision with date, author, evidence, alternatives considered and affected outputs.
Keep rejected specifications visible.

## Verification states

Mark results **proposed**, **source-verified**, **fixture-tested**, **run on acquired data**, or
**independently reproduced**. A checksum shows byte identity, not validity of the source, join or inference.
